---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Features - Varve" description="Explore what Varve can do today — vector design, raster editing, layout, typography, motion, prototyping, color management, and code export.">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="features-page">
      <h1>Features</h1>
      <p class="features-intro">
        What Varve can do today, with honest status indicators for each area. Varve is in beta — features are functional but evolving.
      </p>

      <div class="features-grid">
        <a href="/features/canvas" class="feature-card">
          <h2>Canvas & Rendering</h2>
          <p>Infinite canvas, viewport culling, sticky snap, rulers, guides, grid overlays, multi-page documents</p>
          <span class="status built">Built</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/features/vector-tools" class="feature-card">
          <h2>Vector Tools</h2>
          <p>Shapes, pen and pencil with bezier handles, boolean operations, node editing, layers, groups, frames</p>
          <span class="status built">Built</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/features/typography" class="feature-card">
          <h2>Typography</h2>
          <p>Multi-line text, OpenType features, variable fonts, text-on-path, inline editing, CJK line breaking</p>
          <span class="status built">Built</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/features/color-effects" class="feature-card">
          <h2>Color & Effects</h2>
          <p>RGB and CMYK color management, ICC profiles, blend modes, shadows, blur, adjustment layers, halftone</p>
          <span class="status built">Built</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/features/motion" class="feature-card">
          <h2>Motion & Prototyping</h2>
          <p>Timeline animation, keyframes, easing, Smart Animate, prototype interactions, CSS/Lottie/video export</p>
          <span class="status built">Built</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/features/export" class="feature-card">
          <h2>Export & Code Generation</h2>
          <p>SVG, React/Tailwind, Flutter, SwiftUI, PDF with CMYK, PDF/X-1a and PDF/X-4, per-node export settings</p>
          <span class="status built">Built</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="status-legend">
        <h3>What the status labels mean</h3>
        <div class="legend-items">
          <div class="legend-item">
            <span class="legend-status built"></span>
            <span>Functional and tested. May have rough edges or missing polish.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="legend-item">
            <span class="legend-status partial"></span>
            <span>Core foundation exists. Some capabilities are deferred or incomplete.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="legend-item">
            <span class="legend-status in-development"></span>
            <span>Actively being built. Types and structure exist, rendering is in progress.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .features-page {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  
  .features-page h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .features-intro {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .feature-card {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: all var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-default);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
  }
  
  .feature-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  
  .feature-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .feature-card p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  .status {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
  }
  
  .status.built {
    background: var(--status-built);
    color: var(--text-on-status);
  }
  
  .status.partial {
    background: var(--status-partial);
    color: var(--text-on-status);
  }
  
  .status.in-development {
    background: var(--status-dev);
    color: var(--text-on-status);
  }
  
  .status-legend {
    background: var(--surface-muted);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .status-legend h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .legend-items {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .legend-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .legend-status {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  
  .legend-status.built {
    background: var(--status-built);
  }
  
  .legend-status.partial {
    background: var(--status-partial);
  }
  
  .legend-status.in-development {
    background: var(--status-dev);
  }
</style>
